    "shortInfo": "Rajasthan Board of Secondary Education (RBSE) has officially announced the Class 10th Board exam results. Students can check their marksheets online using their roll number through the official portal. Read our step-by-step guide below to download your scorecard without any hassle.",
    "totalVacancies": "",
