    "fullDescription": "### IBPS RRB Gramin Bank 15th Online Form 2026\n\nInstitute of Banking Personnel Selection releases CRP RRB XV notification annually to select officers and office assistants for Participating Regional Rural Banks.\n\n#### Selection Procedure\n- **Office Assistant:** Preliminary Examination, Main Examination.\n- **Officer Scale I:** Preliminary Exam, Main Exam, Personal Interview.\n- **Officer Scale II & III:** Single Level Online Exam followed by Interview.\n\n#### Important Declaration Format\nCandidates must write standard handwritten declaration in English before uploading.",
