    "fullDescription": "### ICF Chennai Apprentices Recruitment 2026\nIntegral Coach Factory (ICF) Chennai, Indian Railways, invites online applications for 1010 Trade Apprentice positions in Fitter, Electrician, Machinist, Welder, Carpenter, and PASAA trades.\n\n### Selection Process\nMerit list will be prepared based on Class 10th marks (for Freshers) and 10th + ITI marks (for Ex-ITI). There will be no written examination.\n\n### Stipend\n- Non-ITI (1st Year): Rs. 6,000/- per month\n- Non-ITI (2nd Year) / Ex-ITI: Rs. 7,000/- per month",
