    "fullDescription": "### India Post GDS Recruitment 2026 Overview\nDepartment of Posts, India, has announced recruitment for 23,757 vacancies for the posts of Gramin Dak Sevak (GDS), Branch Postmaster (BPM), and Assistant Branch Postmaster (ABPM). Candidates who have completed 10th standard with local language proficiency are eligible to apply.\n\n### Selection Process\nThe selection for India Post GDS 2026 is purely merit-based on Class 10th Board examination marks. No written examination or interview will be conducted. System-generated merit lists will be published circle-wise.\n\n### Pay Scale\n- **Branch Postmaster (BPM):** Rs. 12,000/- to Rs. 29,380/-\n- **Assistant Branch Postmaster (ABPM) / GDS:** Rs. 10,000/- to Rs. 24,470/-",
