    "category": "Economy",
    "summary": "The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) has issued revised regulatory guidelines tightening governance, capital adequacy, and transparency norms for Asset Reconstruction Companies (ARCs). These measures are intended to strengthen the resolution of distressed assets in the Indian banking system.",
