    "category": "International",
    "summary": "India and Australia have inked a landmark bilateral agreement focusing on joint research, processing, and supply chain resilience for critical minerals. The pact aims to secure uninterrupted access to lithium, cobalt, and rare earth elements essential for India's clean energy transition.",
