    "date": "11 September 2026",
    "category": "Appointments",
    "summary": "In exercise of the powers conferred by the Constitution of India, Justice Bhushan Ramkrishna Gavai has been appointed as the 53rd Chief Justice of India. He will assume office following the retirement of the incumbent Chief Justice.",
