    "date": "11 September 2026",
    "category": "Economy",
    "summary": "The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) has rolled out a unified regulatory framework to streamline digital lending operations and safeguard consumer interests. The guidelines mandate strict transparency in algorithmic lending and grievance redressal mechanisms.",
