    "category": "Economy",
    "summary": "The Reserve Bank of India has issued an updated cybersecurity framework mandating a 3-tier Security Operations Centre structure for Tier-3 and Tier-4 Urban Cooperative Banks. The directive aims to safeguard customer funds and prevent digital fraud across regional banking networks.",
