    "summary": "India's space agency, ISRO, achieved a major milestone by completing a long-duration hot test of its 2000 kN semi-cryogenic engine at the ISRO Propulsion Complex in Mahendragiri. The engine utilizes refined kerosene (Isrosene) and liquid oxygen as propellants, significantly increasing payload capacity for future heavy-lift launch vehicles.",
